OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GExclusive music-making, including
OL,6,     Gsoprano Katharina Konradi and
OL,7,     Gpianist Joseph Middleton live
OL,8,     Gfrom London's Wigmore Hall and
OL,9,     GMozart's Symphony No. 35 in D
OL,10,     Gfrom Germany.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,12,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,13,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,14,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,15,     GRoach.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GKatie Derham talks to artist and
OL,18,     Gwriter Edmund de Waal about the
OL,19,     Gnew BBC Two documentary
OL,20,     GCivilisations: Rise and Fall.
OL,21,     GThere's live music from Anglo-
OL,22,     GIrish traditional band Flook.
